+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's recorded decision is to use an LRU (least recently used) eviction strategy combined with a 300-second TTL: entries are evicted based on access recency, and any entry also expires automatically once it has been in the cache for 300 seconds, whichever comes first.
